ash\n-DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr -DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR=lib\n```\n- Install prefix: `/usr` (standard system location)\n- Library directory: `lib` (not `lib64`, which some distros use)\n\n## The Compilers\n\n```bash\n-DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=icx -DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=icpx\n```\n- `ic"}